        <div class="service-name">Adams Jones Law Firm, P.A.</div>
        <div class="service-desc">Webflow Redesign &amp; CMS Buildout for Adams Jones Law Firm, P.A. — a full site rebuild with a structured CMS, a mobile-first layout, and zero developer dependency going forward.</div>
        <div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Webflow</span><span class="tag">CMS</span><span class="tag">Web Design</span></div>
        <a href="/portfolio/" class="service-arrow" style="text-decoration:none;" aria-label="View the Adams Jones Law Firm project on Portfolio">↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <span class="service-num">02</span>
        <div class="service-name">When Nobody Owns IT</div>
        <div class="service-desc">Building a Triage System for a Professional Office — replacing an informal "mention it to whoever's nearby" process with a lightweight triage system that actually stuck. 6 min read.</div>
        <div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Flask</span><span class="tag">SQLite</span></div>
        <a href="/work/it-triage/" class="service-arrow" style="text-decoration:none;" aria-label="Read the IT triage write-up">↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <span class="service-num">03</span>
        <div class="service-name">The 30-Day Window</div>
        <div class="service-desc">Why Offboarding Is Where Security Actually Breaks — building a one-page audit framework that catches what informal processes consistently miss. 5 min read.</div>
        <div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Access Control</span><span class="tag">IT Audit</span><span class="tag">Process</span></div>
        <a href="/work/onboarding-offboarding/" class="service-arrow" style="text-decoration:none;" aria-label="Read the offboarding security write-up">↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:32px;text-align:right;">
      <a href="/work/" class="btn-ghost">View All Work →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HOW I WORK -->
<div style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-num">03</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">How I<br><em>Work</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card service-card--compact reveal">
        <span class="service-num">01</span>
        <div class="service-desc">You send the form or email directly.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card service-card--compact reveal">
        <span class="service-num">02</span>
        <div class="service-desc">I reply within 24 hours with a few targeted questions.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card service-card--compact reveal">
        <span class="service-num">03</span>
        <div class="service-desc">A 30-minute intake call to assess fit and clarify what I'd need to see.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card service-card--compact reveal">
        <span class="service-num">04</span>
        <div class="service-desc">I review your current site, materials, or process documentation.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card service-card--compact reveal">
        <span class="service-num">05</span>
        <div class="service-desc">You receive a written proposal with scope, timeline, and fixed price.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card service-card--compact reveal">
        <span class="service-num">06</span>
        <div class="service-desc">We align on scope, sign off on the proposal, and the work begins — defined timeline, clear deliverables, no surprises.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:32px;text-align:right;">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost">Start a Project →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- TOOLS I'VE BUILT -->
<div style="background:var(--bg2);border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-num">04</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tools I've<br><em>Built</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <span class="service-num">01</span>
        <div class="service-name">SortShelf</div>
